{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1706-p2","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《稼轩词编年笺注》卷五（上海古籍出版社1993年版）。永遇乐，词牌名。这首词作于宋宁宗开禧元年（1205）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔寄奴曾住〕寄奴是南朝宋武帝刘裕（363—422）的小名。刘裕的祖先移居京口，他在这里起事，晚年推翻东晋做了皇帝。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔想当年，金戈铁马，气吞万里如虎〕刘裕曾两次率领东晋军队北伐，收复洛阳、长安等地。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔元嘉草草〕南朝宋文帝刘义隆好大喜功，仓促北伐，遭到重创。元嘉，宋文帝刘义隆的年号（424—453）。草草，轻率。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔封狼居胥〕汉武帝元狩四年（前119），霍去病远征匈奴，歼敌七万余，封狼居胥山而还。封，登山祭天，以纪功勋。狼居胥，山名，即今蒙古国境内的肯特山。这里用“元嘉北伐”暗示南宋朝廷要汲取历史教训。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔北顾〕败逃中回头北望。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔四十三年〕作者于宋高宗绍兴三十二年（1162）南归，到写这首词时正好四十三年。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔烽火扬州路〕扬州一带抗金的烽火。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔佛（bì）狸祠〕北魏太武帝拓跋焘（408—452）小名“佛狸”。公元450年，他反击刘宋，兵锋南下，在长江北岸瓜步山上建立行宫，后称“佛狸祠”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔神鸦〕指在庙里吃祭品的乌鸦。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔社鼓〕社日祭祀土地神的鼓声。南宋时期，当地老百姓只把佛狸祠当作一般祠庙来祭祀供奉，而不知道它过去曾是北魏皇帝的行宫。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔廉颇老矣，尚能饭否〕据《史记·廉颇蔺相如列传》，战国时赵国名将廉颇被免职后跑到魏国，后来赵王想重新起用他，派人去探看他的身体状况。廉颇在使者面前吃下饭一斗、肉十斤，披甲上马，以示尚可大用。使者受廉颇仇人郭开的贿赂，回来报告赵王说：“廉将军虽老，尚善饭，然与臣坐，顷之三遗矢矣。”（矢，同“屎”。）赵王以为廉颇已老，遂不召。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11138-23"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"永遇乐·京口北固亭怀古","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11138-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n辛弃疾\n\n千古江山，英雄无觅，孙仲谋处。舞榭歌台，风流总被，雨打风吹去。斜阳草树，寻常巷陌，人道寄奴曾住","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11138-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。想当年，金戈铁马，气吞万里如虎","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11138-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n元嘉草草","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11138-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，封狼居胥","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11138-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，赢得仓皇北顾","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11138-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。四十三年","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11138-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，望中犹记，烽火扬州路","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11138-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。可堪回首，佛狸祠","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11138-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"下，一片神鸦","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11138-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"社鼓","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11138-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。凭谁问：廉颇老矣，尚能饭否","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11138-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11138-2","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11138-1","postId":"11138-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11138-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11138-2","postId":"11138-2","